51,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,"@Minato, I cannot promise that. The groundwork is missing, and the developers are unavailable. We must accept that uncertainty rather than hide it.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,George,,"@Minato, I cannot promise that either. The fixed fee holds for now, but the renewal notice is where the real bill arrives.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
