54,2,4,talk,Midori,,"@Minato, I can’t promise perfection, but I can promise we’ll measure the daily time saved. Let’s ensure the effort truly drops, not just moves.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
